ent-OnyxBayMobGoliath = goliath
    .desc = A massive beast that uses long tentacles to ensnare its prey, threatening them is not advised under any conditions.
ent-OnyxBayMobGoliathAlpha = alpha goliath
    .desc = A massive beast that uses long tentacles to ensnare its prey, threatening them is not advised under any conditions. This one looks especially ancient with its armor plates overgrown.
ent-OnyxBayEffectGoliathTentacle = goliath tentacle
ent-OnyxBayGoliathTentacle = goliath tentacle
ent-OnyxBayMobShockzard = shockzard
    .desc = A territorial reptile-like beast, covered in a thick shell that absorbs energy. A huge crystal on its long tail emits some sparks when the beast is nervous.
ent-OnyxBayShockzardBolt = energy blast
ent-OnyxBayMobBeholder = beholder
    .desc = Floating orb of flesh with a large creepy mouth, hateful single central eye, and many smaller flexible eyestalks on top. It looks kinda ancient.
ent-OnyxBayMobHoverhead = hoverhead
    .desc = Strange hovering humanoid with exaggerated head and degenerated limbs. His gigantic head constantly emits forcefield of unknown origins.
ent-OnyxBayMobPsychokineticAnomaly = psychokinetic anomaly
    .desc = A strange space-time anomaly that boils and compresses all matter around it.
ent-OnyxBayAnomalousCore = anomalous core
    .desc = Strange biostructure that constantly emits bursts of energy. It has two flaps and a juicy core that looks squeezable.

ent-OnyxBayActionGoliathAlphaTentacle = tentacles
ent-OnyxBayActionGoliathTentacle = tentacles

fauna-onyxbay-beholder-gaze = {CAPITALIZE(THE($user))}'s evil gaze chills {THE($target)} to the bone!
ent-OnyxBayClothingHeadHelmetGoliath = goliath tailplate
    .desc = An old goliath's tailplate. It's exceptionally tough, yet quite soft on the inside and, surprisingly, matches a human head's size.
ent-OnyxBayBeholderEye = The Hateful Eye
    .desc = The jellied, dead eye that still looks hateful and full of unknown powers. What a mighty beast owned that!
